@startuml RAG_Sync_Question
title 1. 统一 LangGraph 同步问答时序

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "用户 / API 客户端" as User
participant "FastAPI\n问答入口" as API
participant "鉴权与知识库权限" as Auth
participant "ChatService\n（仅会话入口）" as Chat
participant "RAGConcurrency" as Limit
participant "RAGService / Runtime" as RAG
database "SQLAlchemy\nSQLite / PostgreSQL" as SQL
participant "Compiled LangGraph" as Graph
participant "Rewrite / Router LLM" as RouteLLM
participant "Scope Resolver" as Scope
participant "Text Retriever" as Text
participant "Graph Retriever" as KG
participant "Code Retriever" as Code
database "Chroma\n文档/实体向量" as Chroma
participant "Fuse + Reranker" as Rank
participant "ContextBuilder" as Context
participant "Answer LLM" as AnswerLLM

User -> API : 提交 query + 可选 retrieval options
API -> Auth : 校验登录身份

alt POST /ask
  Auth -> Auth : 使用默认知识库
else POST /knowledge-bases/{kb_id}/ask
  Auth -> SQL : 校验 knowledge_base read 权限
else POST /conversations/{id}/messages
  Auth -> Chat : 校验会话归属
  Chat -> SQL : 保存 user message、读取最近历史
end

API -> Limit : 获取 RAG 并发许可
Limit -> RAG : ask(query, history, kb_id, retrieval)
RAG -> SQL : 读取活动索引与 index_signature
alt index_signature 已变化
  RAG -> RAG : 失效 Runtime / Graph / BM25 缓存
  RAG -> SQL : 重新构建当前知识库 Runtime
end
RAG -> Graph : invoke(generation_mode="sync")

Graph -> RouteLLM : rewrite(original_query, history)
alt 改写成功且有效
  RouteLLM --> Graph : original + rewritten queries
else 改写失败或无效
  RouteLLM --> Graph : 只保留 original query
end

Graph -> Scope : route_request(explicit → rules → optional LLM)
opt 规则未形成强意图且启用混合路由
  Scope -> RouteLLM : 要求 JSON channels
  RouteLLM --> Scope : text / graph / code
end
Scope -> SQL : 按 kb_id 解析 document/tag/folder/metadata
SQL --> Scope : allowed_document_ids
Scope --> Graph : route + scope_match_count

par text_retrieve
  Graph -> Text : original + rewritten queries + allowed IDs
  Text -> Chroma : 文档向量检索（范围 Filter）
  Text -> SQL : 中文 BM25（当前 KB Chunk）
  Text -> Text : 通道内 Weighted RRF
  Text --> Graph : text_docs / skipped / error
else graph_retrieve
  Graph -> KG : 词法实体 + 可选实体向量种子
  KG -> Chroma : 实体语义向量检索
  KG -> SQL : 1~2 跳关系、Overlay、Evidence 回链 Chunk
  KG --> Graph : graph_docs / skipped / error
else code_retrieve
  Graph -> Code : 搜索活动快照符号
  Code -> SQL : 符号、源码摘录、调用/依赖关系
  Code --> Graph : code_docs / skipped / error
end

Graph -> Rank : Fan-in + 通道加权 RRF + chunk_id 去重
Rank -> Rank : original_query 重排；失败保留融合排序
Rank --> Graph : top documents + channel_results
Graph -> Context : 去重、来源配额、Chunk/Token 预算、引用
Context --> Graph : context + sources
Graph -> AnswerLLM : generate(original_query, history, context)
AnswerLLM --> Graph : answer
Graph --> RAG : answer + sources + route
RAG --> Limit : 释放许可

alt 会话入口
  Limit --> Chat : 回答结果
  Chat -> SQL : 保存 completed assistant message\n失败时保存 failed message
  Chat --> API : user_message + assistant_message
else 无会话入口
  Limit --> API : answer + sources + route
end
API --> User : JSON 响应

note over Text,Code
  三个节点是独立 LangGraph 分支。
  route 未选择时返回 skipped；单通道异常记录 error，
  不阻断其余通道和最终回答。
end note

note over API,Graph
  retrieval/debug 复用相同流程，
  但 generation_mode=context，在 build_context 后结束，
  返回 route、sources 与 context_preview，不调用 Answer LLM。
end note

@enduml

@startuml RAG_SSE_Question
title 2. Web SSE 问答时序

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Web 用户" as User
participant "Web api/client.ts" as Web
participant "FastAPI SSE Route" as API
participant "ChatService" as Chat
database "SQLAlchemy" as SQL
participant "RAGService" as RAG
participant "Compiled LangGraph" as Graph
participant "Text / Graph / Code" as Retrieval
participant "ContextBuilder" as Context
participant "Answer LLM.stream" as LLM

User -> Web : 发送消息
Web -> API : POST .../messages/stream
API -> Chat : answer_stream(content, retrieval)
Chat -> SQL : 校验会话归属并保存 user message
Chat -> SQL : 创建 status=streaming 的 assistant message
Chat --> API : event: message {message_id}
API --> Web : SSE message

Chat -> RAG : stream(query, history, kb_id)
RAG -> Graph : invoke(generation_mode="context")
Graph -> Retrieval : rewrite → route → 三通道并行 → fuse → rerank
Retrieval --> Graph : docs + route/channel_results
Graph -> Context : build_context(docs)
Context --> Graph : context + sources
Graph --> RAG : END（不执行 generate 节点）

RAG --> Chat : event: route
Chat --> API : event: route
API --> Web : SSE route
RAG -> LLM : stream(original_query, history, context)
loop 模型流式分片
  LLM --> RAG : delta
  RAG --> Chat : event: delta
  Chat --> API : event: delta
  API --> Web : SSE delta
  Web --> User : 增量显示
end
RAG --> Chat : event: sources
Chat --> API : event: sources
API --> Web : SSE sources
Chat -> SQL : assistant = completed\n保存正文、sources、route
Chat --> API : event: done
API --> Web : SSE done

alt 任一步骤异常
  Chat -> SQL : assistant = failed + error_message
  Chat --> API : event: error
  API --> Web : SSE error（不发送 done）
end

note over Graph,LLM
  SSE 的 rewrite、路由、检索、融合、重排和上下文
  均由统一 compiled LangGraph 完成；
  只有最终 Token 流由同一 Runtime 的 LLM.stream 在图外输出。
end note

@enduml

@startuml Document_Index_Job
title 3. 文档上传与持久化索引任务时序

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "管理员 / editor" as Admin
participant "Documents API" as API
participant "DocumentIndexService" as Service
database "ObjectStore\nlocal / MinIO" as ObjectStore
database "SQL Metadata" as SQL
queue "TaskQueue\ninline / Celery" as Queue
participant "IndexWorker" as Worker
participant "Lease Heartbeat" as Lease
participant "Loader + Chunker" as Parser
participant "EmbeddingProvider" as Embedding
database "Chroma 文档索引" as Chroma
participant "Cache / Readiness" as Cache

Admin -> API : 单个/批量上传或重建
API -> API : 校验 edit 权限、格式、文件数与大小
API -> Service : create file/rebuild job
Service -> ObjectStore : 保存原文对象和不可变版本
Service -> SQL : 文档 pending + version\n创建 IndexJob / Item / Event
Service -> Queue : enqueue(job_id)
API --> Admin : 202 + job_id + 拒绝文件清单

alt local Profile
  Queue -> Worker : 唤醒进程内 Worker
else enterprise Profile
  Queue -> Worker : Celery 投递（数据库仍为事实源）
end

Worker -> SQL : 原子 claim、attempt+1、lease_owner/expires_at
Worker -> Lease : 启动周期心跳

alt file / delete 任务
  loop 每个未完成 Item
    Worker -> SQL : 检查 cancel_requested，Item=running
    alt delete
      Worker -> Chroma : 删除文档旧向量
      Worker -> SQL : 删除/停用文档与 Chunk
    else file
      Worker -> ObjectStore : materialize(source_path)
      ObjectStore --> Worker : 临时本地 Path
      Worker -> Parser : 解析 TXT/PDF/MD/DOCX/HTML 并切片
      Parser --> Worker : deterministic chunks
      Worker -> Embedding : 分批 passage embedding
      Embedding --> Worker : vectors
      Worker -> Chroma : 写入活动 Collection
      Worker -> SQL : 事务替换文档元数据和 Chunk\n标记 ready，更新 index_signature
      Worker -> Chroma : 成功后清理旧向量
    end
    Worker -> SQL : Item completed/failed + Job 进度事件
  end
else rebuild 全量影子任务
  note over Worker,Chroma
    当前 rebuild 分支是默认知识库本地目录的兼容流程；
    企业对象存储中的文档应通过持久化 file/reindex 任务重建。
  end note
  Worker -> Chroma : 创建 documents_build_* 影子 Collection
  loop 所有支持文档
    Worker -> ObjectStore : 读取对象
    Worker -> Parser : Loader + Chunker
    Worker -> Embedding : 批量 Embedding
    Worker -> Chroma : 写影子 Collection
  end
  Worker -> Chroma : 校验数量与完整 Chunk ID 集
  alt 校验通过
    Worker -> SQL : 单事务替换 Chunk\n切换 active_collection
  else 任一文档或校验失败
    Worker -> Chroma : 清理失败影子索引
    Worker -> SQL : 保持旧活动索引
  end
end

Worker -> Lease : 停止心跳
Worker -> SQL : Job completed / partial / failed / cancelled
Worker -> Cache : 清 Runtime/Graph/BM25/Readiness 本地缓存\n发布失效通知

note over Queue,Worker
  Queue 只负责投递或唤醒，index_jobs 才是任务状态事实源。
  Worker 丢失后由租约恢复机制把过期任务重新置为 pending。
end note

note over SQL,Chroma
  文档索引完成后，新 Chunk 的 graph_status 为 pending；
  不会自动抽取知识图谱，图谱由独立 graph_rebuild 任务执行。
end note

@enduml

@startuml Knowledge_Graph_Build
title 4. 文档知识图谱构建与治理时序

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "知识库管理员 / editor" as Admin
participant "Graph Governance API" as API
database "SQL Job + Graph Tables" as SQL
queue "TaskQueue" as Queue
participant "IndexWorker" as Worker
participant "GraphBuildService" as Build
participant "Schema Registry" as Schema
database "Extraction Cache" as Cache
participant "Extraction LLM" as LLM
participant "Validator + Normalizer" as Quality
participant "GraphGovernanceService" as Governance
participant "EntityVectorService" as EntityVector
database "Chroma 实体向量" as Chroma

Admin -> API : POST .../knowledge-graph/build\nmode=pending/retry_failed/full
API -> API : 校验 edit 权限
API -> SQL : 去重未完成 graph_rebuild\n创建持久任务
API -> Queue : enqueue(job_id)
API --> Admin : 202 + job_id

Queue -> Worker : 投递任务
Worker -> SQL : claim + lease heartbeat
Worker -> Build : build_graph(mode)
Build -> SQL : 恢复遗留 processing → pending
Build -> Schema : 获取当前 KB active Schema
Schema --> Build : entity types、relation dictionary\nextraction_prompt、version
Build -> SQL : 选择 ready 文档的 Chunk\n按 mode 过滤并标记 processing

loop 按 Chunk 数和字符预算分批
  par 并行抽取 Worker
    Build -> Cache : lookup(content + schema + model fingerprint)
    alt cache hit
      Cache --> Build : 解析候选
    else cache miss
      Build -> LLM : Schema 约束 Prompt + Chunk 原文
      LLM --> Build : JSON entities / relations
      Build -> Cache : 保存可复用抽取结果
    end
    Build -> Quality : JSON、实体类型、关系字典\nlocal_id、自环、Evidence 原文定位\n置信度与端点校验
    Quality --> Build : accepted facts + rejected reasons
  end

  Build -> SQL : 顺序替换每个 Chunk 的旧图结果\n固定 NFKC 名称标准化\n实体/关系去重与 Upsert\n保存 Alias/Mention/Relation/Evidence
  Build -> SQL : Chunk completed 或 failed
end

Build -> SQL : 清理孤儿实体/关系\n协调人工校正 Overlay
Build --> Worker : succeeded / failed / skipped
Worker -> Governance : assess_quality()
Governance -> SQL : 质量报告、门禁结果、Review Queue

opt rebuild_communities=true
  Worker -> Governance : rebuild_communities()
  Governance -> SQL : 全局 root + 连通分量子社区\n确定性摘要与成员 Evidence
end

opt rebuild_entity_vectors=true
  Worker -> EntityVector : rebuild()
  EntityVector -> SQL : 读取实体、计算图/Embedding 指纹
  EntityVector -> Chroma : 构建影子实体 Collection 并校验
  EntityVector -> SQL : 激活索引状态，清理旧 Collection
end

alt 抽取失败或质量门禁未通过
  Worker -> SQL : Job=partial + 明确错误
else 全部通过
  Worker -> SQL : Job=completed
end

note over Quality,SQL
  去幻觉依赖 Schema、关系字典、端点和 Evidence 原文门禁；
  相似度只生成待人工复核的合并候选，不自动合并实体。
  人工合并是可撤销的逻辑 Overlay，不破坏底层事实。
end note

@enduml

@startuml Connector_Synchronization
title 5. 数据源连接器与周期调度时序

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "管理员 / editor" as Admin
participant "Connector Scheduler\nlocal timer / Celery Beat" as Scheduler
participant "Sources API" as API
database "SQL DataSource + Jobs" as SQL
queue "TaskQueue" as Queue
participant "DataSourceService" as Source
participant "CredentialResolver" as Credential
participant "Git / S3 / Local Directory" as External
database "ObjectStore" as Objects
participant "DocumentIndexService" as Documents
participant "CodeIndexService" as CodeIndex

alt 手工同步
  Admin -> API : POST .../sources/{id}/sync
  API -> SQL : 校验 edit 权限和 source 状态
else 周期同步
  Scheduler -> SQL : 查询 active 且 next_sync_at 到期的数据源
  Scheduler -> Source : request_sync(source_id)
end

alt local_directory
  API -> Source : 当前线程执行轻量扫描
  Source -> External : 校验允许根目录、枚举文件
  External --> Source : 文件列表
else Git / S3
  API -> SQL : 创建父 connector_sync Job
  API -> Queue : enqueue(parent_job_id)
  API --> Admin : 202（立即返回）
  Queue -> Source : Worker 执行 connector_sync
  Source -> Credential : resolve env:// 或 file://
  Credential --> Source : Token / JSON 凭据（不落库）
  alt Git
    Source -> External : 浅克隆到临时目录、读取 revision
  else S3 / MinIO
    Source -> External : 分页列举 s3://bucket/prefix\n按大小限制下载
  end
  External --> Source : 文件、revision/cursor、拒绝项
end

Source -> Source : Hash 比对新增/修改/未变\n识别同内容重命名\n应用 ignore/delete 删除策略
Source -> Objects : 保存原文和版本对象
Source -> Documents : 创建子 file/delete 索引任务
Documents -> SQL : 持久化 child Job / Items
Documents -> Queue : enqueue(child_job_id)

opt local/Git 且 index_code=true
  Source -> CodeIndex : 当前连接器调用线程内同步构建代码索引
end

Source -> SQL : 保存 sync_cursor、last status/detail\nlast_synced_at、next_sync_at
Source --> API : accepted / skipped / rejected + child job

note over SQL,Documents
  父 connector_sync 完成表示采集、落对象和子任务创建成功；
  不表示 child file Job 已完成切片、Embedding 和向量写入。
end note

note over Scheduler,Queue
  local 使用进程内 Scheduler；enterprise 使用 Celery Beat。
  到期调度和人工点击最终都落到同一持久化任务模型。
end note

@enduml

@startuml Code_Graph_Index
title 6. 代码图索引与在线检索时序

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "管理员 / editor" as Admin
participant "Code Graph API" as API
database "SQL Jobs" as Jobs
queue "TaskQueue" as Queue
participant "IndexWorker" as Worker
participant "CodeIndexService" as Indexer
participant "DataSourceService" as Source
participant "CodeParser" as Parser
database "ObjectStore" as Objects
database "SQL Code Graph" as GraphDB
participant "CodeGraphRetriever" as Retriever
participant "LangGraph code_retrieve" as CodeNode

Admin -> API : POST .../code-graph/index {data_source_id}
API -> API : 校验 edit 权限；仅 local_directory / Git
API -> Jobs : 去重 open code_index，创建任务
API -> Queue : enqueue(job_id)
API --> Admin : 202 + job_id
Queue -> Worker : 投递任务
Worker -> Jobs : claim + lease

alt local_directory
  Worker -> Source : 解析允许的本地根目录
  Source --> Indexer : directory Path
else Git
  Worker -> Source : 浅克隆到临时目录、获取 revision
  Source --> Indexer : repository Path + revision
end

Indexer -> Indexer : 扫描支持后缀\n排除依赖/构建目录、符号链接和超大文件\n计算内容 fingerprint
alt fingerprint 与活动快照相同
  Indexer --> Worker : unchanged（不创建重复快照）
else 内容变化
  Indexer -> GraphDB : 创建 status=building Snapshot
  par 并行解析文件
    Indexer -> Parser : parse(path, source)
    alt Python
      Parser -> Parser : stdlib ast 提取符号与关系
    else 其他支持语言
      Parser -> Parser : Tree-sitter 语法解析/恢复检查\n当前由确定性 Regex emitter 提取事实
    end
    Parser --> Indexer : ParsedFile（临时 AST 不持久化）
  end
  Indexer -> Objects : 保存代码源副本
  Indexer -> GraphDB : 保存 File / Symbol\nCONTAINS / IMPORTS / CALLS / EXTENDS
  Indexer -> Indexer : 跨文件名称解析
  Indexer -> GraphDB : 标记 resolved / ambiguous / external\n保留行号和源码摘录
  Indexer -> GraphDB : 新 Snapshot=active\n旧 Snapshot=superseded\n按 retention 清理历史
  Indexer --> Worker : files/symbols/relations 统计
end

Worker -> Jobs : completed / failed

Admin -> API : GET symbols 或 subgraph
API -> GraphDB : 只查询活动 Snapshot
GraphDB --> API : 符号、调用/依赖边、源码行号
API --> Admin : Code Graph DTO

CodeNode -> Retriever : 在线问题命中 code 通道
Retriever -> GraphDB : 搜索活动符号并扩展关系
GraphDB --> Retriever : symbols + relations
Retriever --> CodeNode : 代码检索 Documents

note over Parser,GraphDB
  静态分析不承诺解析动态调用、反射、宏和运行时注入；
  不确定的关系保留 resolution_status，不伪造确定调用边。
end note

@enduml
